Perfect! I've retrieved 5 liked albums. Now I need to determine which albums to keep. An album is considered to be kept if all its songs are downloaded. I'll first extract the song IDs from the downloaded songs and then check each album to see if all its songs are downloaded.

Code:
```python
# Extract song IDs from downloaded songs
downloaded_song_ids = {song['song_id'] for song in downloaded_songs}

# Albums to keep are those that are liked or have all songs downloaded
albums_to_keep = []

for album in albums:
    if album['album_id'] in [liked_album['album_id'] for liked_album in liked_albums]:
        albums_to_keep.append(album['album_id'])
    else:
        # Check if all songs in the album are downloaded
        if all(song_id in downloaded_song_ids for song_id in album['song_ids']):
            albums_to_keep.append(album['album_id'])

print(f"Will keep {len(albums_to_keep)} albums")
```

