Perfect! The `show_song` API returns the song title and artist information. I'll loop through all unique songs to get their details.

Code:
```python
song_details = {}

for song_id in unique_songs:
    try:
        details = apis.spotify.show_song(song_id=song_id)
        song_details[song_id] = {
            "title": details["title"],
            "artists": [artist["name"] for artist in details["artists"]]
        }
    except Exception as e:
        print(f"Failed to retrieve details for song {song_id}: {e}")

print(f"Retrieved details for {len(song_details)} songs")
